WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
The whole stage freezes, except one man.

2
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.130
He steps right to the front
and talks straight to us.

3
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:11.440
In Act 1 he told Roderigo,
"I am not what I am."

4
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:18.330
Now, alone with us, he says it plainly: "I
hate the Moor," Then the reasons arrive.

5
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.110
A promotion he didn't get.

6
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.940
A rumour about his wife.

7
00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:22.870
Revenge.

8
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.030
Sport.

9
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.730
He hands us motive after motive.

10
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.600
Should we believe him?

11
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.250
In this mission, you'll see how soliloquies
and asides let Iago confide in the

12
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.280
audience.

13
00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.800
You'll line up every reason
he gives, act by act.

14
00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.610
And you'll follow how he uses
Roderigo, Cassio and Emilia as tools.

15
00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.720
Your mission: decide whether
we should believe him.
